wasm module contains no expected data. Error kinds and expected values are
read from the JSON header/body, so the comparison is evaluator-vs-fixture,
the same separation the B3 work order demands. (The runner's gate
implementation is my own restatement of the committed one in
`mathd/tests/evaluator.rs` — `close()` relative/nonzero + exact zero.)

